{"seq":3,"slug":"calligraphy-and-painting","title":"Calligraphy And Painting","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/major-works/calligraphy-and-painting","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-cold-food-observance","title":"寒食帖","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/major-works/calligraphy-and-painting/the-cold-food-observance","wordCount":1594,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"bamboo-and-ink","title":"墨竹与文人画","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/major-works/calligraphy-and-painting/bamboo-and-ink","wordCount":1812,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<p>本章考察苏轼的书画艺术。《黄州寒食帖》，是苏轼被贬黄州时在凄凉苍劲的心境中写就的书法杰作，将书法与情感意趣完美融合，是宋代&quot;尚意&quot;书风的典范，被誉为&quot;天下第三行书&quot;。在绘画上，苏轼擅画墨竹枯木怪石，以画寄意，并以&quot;胸有成竹&quot;等思想奠定了文人画的基础。本章揭示苏轼作为旷世全才在书画领域的非凡造诣。</p>\n"}